{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "依原稿上下文逐句核對，保留原文及段落ID；文字不符時停止匯入，禁止依輪流發話猜測。",
  "annotations": [
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT02_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L013",
      "text": "法伊德又問：「帶去王都的資料有哪些？回報頻率如何？留在學院的人手由誰主責？」",
      "speaker": "FAID",
      "speakerLabel": "法伊德"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT02_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L003",
      "text": "她看著桌面上仍然留著的一部分記錄，忽然低聲說了一句：「我們只是去王都，不是研究計畫宣布死亡。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L004",
      "text": "「北翼還沒消息？」她問。",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L006",
      "text": "「好。」奧莉維亞點頭，「請告訴他們，時間短一點也沒關係。我只想看看父王。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L014",
      "text": "「芬利。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L015",
      "text": "「嗯？」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L016",
      "text": "「我們是不是已經等了半天？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L018",
      "text": "「你還真的算了？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L019",
      "text": "「妳問我是不是半天，我總不能只靠感覺回答。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L021",
      "text": "「我一直想不通。我們家怎麼每次都能把一件這麼簡單的事情搞得那麼久？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L023",
      "text": "「我知道。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L024",
      "text": "「那確實不是一般接見。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L026",
      "text": "「我想見的是我的父親。我又不是要去向他討軍費，更不是要他立刻起床主持御前會議。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L028",
      "text": "「這個差別，妳已經向內廷說明過了。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L029",
      "text": "「不只一次。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01",
      "segmentId": "L030",
      "text": "「那麼妳現在比較想抱怨，還是想做點什麼？」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L003",
      "text": "「嗯。我想知道自己到底在等什麼。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L004",
      "text": "「要我一起去嗎？」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC01_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L005",
      "text": "「不用。」她把召回時帶回來的那封公文收進資料夾，想了想又放下，「這不是研究室的問題。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L004",
      "text": "一位內廷主管上前行禮：「大公主殿下。」",
      "speaker": "NORTH_WING_STEWARD",
      "speakerLabel": "北翼主管"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L005",
      "text": "「我來探望父王。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L006",
      "text": "「殿下，陛下目前仍需休養，恐怕暫時不便接見。」",
      "speaker": "NORTH_WING_STEWARD",
      "speakerLabel": "北翼主管"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L008",
      "text": "她只是問：「這是父王親口說的，還是醫師認為他現在不能見客？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L010",
      "text": "「我問的不是安排的名稱。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L012",
      "text": "「我想知道，是誰作的決定。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L015",
      "text": "「我同意。」她說。",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L017",
      "text": "「但這個解釋只能說明你們不能擅自讓我進去。」奧莉維亞接著說，「不能說明為什麼從昨天到現在，沒有人能告訴我，請求到底送到哪裡。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L019",
      "text": "「如果父王不願見我，我會尊重；如果醫師說不行，我也可以等。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L021",
      "text": "「可如果兩者都不是，誰有權讓這件事一直拖下去？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L023",
      "text": "「那就確認。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L025",
      "text": "「你們可以告訴我，醫師不允許；可以告訴我，父王要休息；甚至可以告訴我，他今天不想見任何人。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L026",
      "text": "「但不能一整天都只告訴我，『還在確認』。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02",
      "segmentId": "L028",
      "text": "「我今天不是來要求你們破例。我是來確認，究竟是誰在替國王作主。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L001",
      "text": "「我沒有要求你們現在開門。」奧莉維亞補充，「但我希望現在就由負責的人，去確認父王本人的意願，以及醫師對短暫探視的意見。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L007",
      "text": "「陛下已經知道殿下在等，並且同意接見。」",
      "speaker": "NORTH_WING_STEWARD",
      "speakerLabel": "北翼主管"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC02_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L009",
      "text": "「謝謝。辛苦了。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L003",
      "text": "「回來了？」他問。",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L005",
      "text": "「父王。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L006",
      "text": "「站在那裡做什麼？」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L009",
      "text": "「聽說妳讓北翼的人緊張得很。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L010",
      "text": "「我沒有吵架。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L011",
      "text": "「是嗎？」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L012",
      "text": "「我只是請他們把程序說清楚。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L013",
      "text": "國王輕輕笑了：「那恐怕比吵架還麻煩。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L016",
      "text": "「您瘦了。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L017",
      "text": "「人上了年紀，總會這樣。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L018",
      "text": "「您上次就這麼說。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L019",
      "text": "「因為這句話每次都適用。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L021",
      "text": "「您真的把我嚇壞了。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L023",
      "text": "「抱歉。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L024",
      "text": "「我從學院收到的就是一封公文。」她說，「上面沒有您的消息，沒有誰能告訴我具體情況。連回來之後，我也得一直等。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L025",
      "text": "「我知道妳不喜歡這樣。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L026",
      "text": "「不只是喜不喜歡。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L028",
      "text": "「我是您的女兒。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L030",
      "text": "「我知道。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L032",
      "text": "「學院那邊，最近還順利嗎？」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC03",
      "segmentId": "L034",
      "text": "「那不是妳平常最喜歡說的事情？」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L002",
      "text": "「您還在工作？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L004",
      "text": "「不是完全沒有。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L005",
      "text": "「醫師不是要您減少勞累？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L006",
      "text": "「所以我才坐在這裡，而不是朝會廳。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L008",
      "text": "「這兩件事並不互相排斥。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L010",
      "text": "「這句話很像妳。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L012",
      "text": "「您現在到底能處理多少事情？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L013",
      "text": "「比以前少得多。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L015",
      "text": "「這件事我不打算再逞強。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L018",
      "text": "「王都還在運作。各官署也都有自己應該做的事。艾維斯在東線，需要我放心讓他去處理那邊的責任。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L019",
      "text": "「那您呢？」奧莉維亞問。",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L020",
      "text": "「我現在要做的是把身體養好。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L022",
      "text": "「等情況改善，我會想辦法慢慢回到朝政裡。先從能負擔的工作開始，聽取報告、處理必要事項，再看醫師允不允許我恢復更多。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L023",
      "text": "「您真的打算回去？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L024",
      "text": "「當然。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L026",
      "text": "「我還是國王。只要我還有能力，就沒有理由讓所有人永遠替我做決定。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L002",
      "text": "「今天先到這裡吧。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L004",
      "text": "「所以我更不想把您累壞。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L005",
      "text": "「說得好像我已經這麼不中用了。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L006",
      "text": "「您剛才才說會聽醫師的。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L008",
      "text": "「奧莉維亞。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L009",
      "text": "「嗯？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L010",
      "text": "「這次回來，妳可以先在王都多住一段時間嗎？」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L012",
      "text": "「我就知道。父王，您把我從學院叫回來，果然不只是為了讓我探病。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L013",
      "text": "「我確實想見妳。」艾爾維爾笑了一下，「但我也希望妳能在身邊待些日子。艾維斯去了東線，我還需要休養；至少有家人在王都，總是好一些。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L014",
      "text": "「王宮不是沒有人辦事。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L015",
      "text": "「當然不是。」國王答得乾脆，「官署照常辦事，該由誰決定的，仍由誰決定。我不是要妳現在接下一個職位，更不是要把我的權力交給妳。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L017",
      "text": "「所以，我現在只需要先留下？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L018",
      "text": "「先留下。其他事情，等妳安頓好，再按正式程序談清楚。妳不必今天給任何人一張空白的承諾。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L020",
      "text": "「您知道我昨天把一些工作退回哥哥那裡嗎？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L021",
      "text": "「知道。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L022",
      "text": "「您不覺得我在推事？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L023",
      "text": "「如果妳連什麼不該由自己決定都分不清楚，我才會擔心。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L025",
      "text": "「好。我先留在王都，至少等您身體好一些。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L026",
      "text": "「那就好。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L027",
      "text": "「不過，」她仍忍不住補上一句，「我們家的『住一段時間』，通常最後都會變成很多工作。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L029",
      "text": "「看來妳還是很了解這個家。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L031",
      "text": "「那您好好休息。我改天再來看您。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L032",
      "text": "「這次我會讓北翼的人早些給妳答覆。」",
      "speaker": "ELVIR",
      "speakerLabel": "艾爾維爾"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC04_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L033",
      "text": "「最好是。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L005",
      "text": "「回來了？」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L006",
      "text": "「嗯。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L007",
      "text": "「見到陛下了？」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L008",
      "text": "「見到了。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L010",
      "text": "「至少他還有精神跟我開玩笑。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L012",
      "text": "「那是好事。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L013",
      "text": "「他還說，等身體好一點，就會想辦法重新處理朝政。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L014",
      "text": "「聽起來他自己仍有打算。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L015",
      "text": "「有。比我想像中還明確。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L017",
      "text": "「而且父王希望我先留在王都一段時間。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L018",
      "text": "「妳答應了？」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L019",
      "text": "「答應了。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L021",
      "text": "「那我們的研究呢？」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L023",
      "text": "「正好。這就是我想找你談的事。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L025",
      "text": "「學院那邊不會因為我們暫時不回去就停擺。」他說，「留守的人會繼續測試。我的外派身分也還有效，我可以整理結果、回報進度，必要時再安排兩地核對。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L026",
      "text": "「我知道。」奧莉維亞說，「只是不能保證我還能像之前那樣，一整天都泡在研究室裡。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L027",
      "text": "「本來就不需要妳一個人做完全部。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L028",
      "text": "「這話從你嘴裡說出來，真有說服力。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L029",
      "text": "「我本來就是團隊的一員。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L032",
      "text": "「那王宮呢？」芬利問。",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L033",
      "text": "「父王只是希望我先留下來。」奧莉維亞答道，「他沒有正式交代我以後要做什麼，也沒有打算讓我代替哥哥或官署。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L034",
      "text": "「這樣反倒好。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L035",
      "text": "「哪裡好？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L036",
      "text": "「妳至少不用現在就替所有未知的工作預留時間。真有新的任務，也該先說清楚內容和權責。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L038",
      "text": "「這一點，我同意得不能再同意。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L040",
      "text": "「只是妳在學院也常說『我就看一下』，最後把別人的項目一起接下來。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05",
      "segmentId": "L041",
      "text": "「……你不能挑一些我比較有面子的往事來回憶嗎？」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L005",
      "text": "「那就先這樣。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L006",
      "text": "「嗯。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L007",
      "text": "「今天還有什麼要做的嗎？」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L009",
      "text": "「沒有。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L011",
      "text": "「妳確定？」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L012",
      "text": "「非常確定。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L013",
      "text": "「那我就不打擾妳了。」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L015",
      "text": "「芬利。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L016",
      "text": "「嗯？」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L018",
      "text": "「明天早上……」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L020",
      "text": "「不要再用『大公主，別睡了』叫醒我。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L022",
      "text": "「那如果妳又睡過頭呢？」",
      "speaker": "FINLEY",
      "speakerLabel": "芬利"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT05_SC05_COMMON",
      "segmentId": "L024",
      "text": "「……至少換個比較好聽的說法。」",
      "speaker": "OLIVIA",
      "speakerLabel": "奧莉維亞"
    }
  ],
  "nonDialogueExceptions": [
    {
      "sceneId": "EP01_ACT01_SC04",
      "segmentId": "L027",
      "text": "「返都後相關職責，另行通知。」",
      "reason": "LETTER_QUOTATION：重讀召回公函的摘句，原稿未表示出聲朗讀。"
    }
  ]
}
